        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esinyatisho oo nkishorot",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Olaitoriani Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tiaaki Aron o layiok lenyena metalama nena tokitin naasinya oo ltung'ana le Israel naaishoo ninche nanu, pee meisarkionie enkarna ai sinyati: Ara nanu Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiaaki ninche, ‘Ore pooki ng'ae tiatua iishoritin inyi pooki, too lporori linyi pooki, tenenyikaki nena tokitin sinyat, naaitisinyakitia iltung'ana le Israel Olaitoriani, eata kereek, ore ilo tung'ani neiwuang'ieki aaitung'uaa ine natii: Ara nanu Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meetae hoo obo le ishoi e Aron oata enkeeya oo lbolot, aashu eruko nkimek oidim ainosa nena tokitin sinyat ometaba anaa neaku bioto. Ore pooki ng'ae oiseyie entoki nemesinya aibung empopok aashu oltung'ani opuku enkare e lewaisho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anaa oloba anaa oloiseyie entoki naikurtutari naidim aidurukie ninye, aashu oltung'ani oidim aitasuroki enkiduruk, naba ake duoo ninye anaa enaata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore ilo tung'ani oiseyie mbaa naaikununo neijia neaku ninye oloiduruk ometaa teipa nemeinos nena tokitin sinyat meteleku ake teneituku osesen lenye te nkare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee edoyio enkolong nemeitoki ninye aiduruk; ore te siadi neidim ninye ainosa nena tokitin sinyat, amu kuna ninche ndaiki enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore entoki natua openy, aashu enainosa ng'uesi entim meinos ninye, apik kewan olduruk te ninche: Ara nanu Olaitoriani!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nchoo naa ninche eibung nkitanapat aainei, pee menap ing'ok te nkaraki ninye, neye ninche teine neisarkionie nkitanapat aainei: Ara nanu Olaitoriani oitisiny ninche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Meinos olomoni ina toki sinyati, ore olomoni lo lapolosani aashu osinka lo lmushaara nemeinos ina toki sinyati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake teneinyang'u olapolosani orrindik too mpisai aitaa emasaai enye makewan, neidim ilo rrindik ainosa ina toki; ore lelo ootoiwuoki tiatua enkaji enye neidim aainosa ina daa enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teneyam oltung'ani leeiking'a entito o lapolosani nemeinos ina tito nena kishorot oo ntokitin sinyat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake tenaa enkoliai ina tito olapolosani aashu etung'uayie olmoruo lenye, nemeeta nkera, neshukunye alotu enkang e menye, anaa apake te keraisho, neidim ninye ainosa ina daa e menye; ore ake eyia meetae oltung'ani leeiking'a oidim ainosa ina daa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa teneinos oltung'ani ina toki sinyati meyiolo ajo endaa sinyati neponiki ninye ematua e imiet e tomon oo ntokitin enyena alak, neisho ina toki sinyati olapolosani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meisarkionie ilapolosak nena tokitin sinyat oo ltung'ana le Israel, naaitarasaki ninche Olaitoriani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aaitarasaki ninche metanapa enkitarruoroto o enkitadiata, te nkinosata e nena tokitin enye sinyat, amu ara nanu Olaitoriani oitisiny ninche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Olaitoriani ajoki Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tiaaki Aron o layiok lenyena o ltung'ana pooki le Israel, Teneitayu ake oltung'ani le nkaji e Siraeli aashu oloeuo amanyisho tiatua Israel olasar lenye, tenaa entoki olmumai lenye aashu tenaa enkishorunoto to ltau lo lpela naitarasakini Olaitoriani anaa olasar opejori, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pooki ake pee eng'amaroyu naa tenaa olbung'ae lemeeta entioto aa oloo nkishu aashu oo loo nkerra aashu o loo nkineji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 17.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kake emipolos ake entoki naata entioto, amu meng'amaroyu ina tialo intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa tenepolos ake ninye oltung'ani olasar le seriani apolosaki Olaitoriani, pee eitabaya olmumai aashu tenaa olasar lo lpela, oing'uaa eluaata oo nkishu aashu eluaata oo ntare, naa pooki ake pee eng'amaroyu naa tenaa bayaroti nemetii entioto atua ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ng'uesi modook aashu ng'ojinia maiman, anaa nemelulung'a seseni anaa enaruko nkimek, anaa enaata olpepedoi, emipolosaki Olaitoriani nena ng'uesi aashu intaikinyenye ilasarri oopejokini te nkima Olaitoriani te nchumata olperere lo lasar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore oloing'oni aashu ositima le ker oata erubata osesen lenye naado aashu endorrop nindimidimi intae aitaa olasar lo lpela, kake ore to lasar le nkitabaroto olmumai menyorrarri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pooki ng'ues natokurdaki ilterege lenyena aashu eidong'oki, aashu etopolosaki aashu etegelemaki mipolosakiki Olaitoriani aashu intaunyenye ilasarri tiatua enkop inyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimintobiriri anaa endaa e Nkai inyi pooki ake ninye ng'ues nayaua oltungani omoni. Amu keeta ninche ntiot tenkaraki melulunga ninche nemeng'amaroyu tialo intae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Olaitoriani Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Teneini olbung'ae aashu ositima le ker aashu ole kine, neton ninye nkolong'i naapishana tenebo ng'otonye, ore te nkolong e isiet neaku keng'amaroyu anaa olasar opejokini te nkima Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa tenaa duoo enkiteng ng'otonye aashu enker nimiyieng ninye tenebo olashe o ngotonye aashu olkuo o ngotonye te nkolong nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa tenipolos olasar le nkishoroto e nashe apolosaki Olaitoriani nipolos naa pee etum ataa keng'amaroyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
